1️⃣5️⃣ ICMP

ICMP = Internet Control Message Protocol

It is used for:

Error reporting

Diagnostics

Network control messages


Example:

Destination Unreachable
Time Exceeded


---

1️⃣6️⃣ Ping

ping commonly uses:

ICMP Echo Request

and:

ICMP Echo Reply

Computer A
    │
    │ Echo Request
    ↓
Computer B
    │
    │ Echo Reply
    ↓
Computer A

So:

> Ping uses ICMP messages.




---

1️⃣7️⃣ Traceroute

Traceroute helps discover the path to a destination.

It relies on the TTL / Hop Limit mechanism and ICMP responses in common implementations.

Example:

You
 ↓
Router 1
 ↓
Router 2
 ↓
Router 3
 ↓
Server

It reveals intermediate hops.


---

1️⃣8️⃣ TTL

IPv4 has:

TTL — Time To Live

Each router decreases TTL.

TTL = 5
   ↓
Router
TTL = 4
   ↓
Router
TTL = 3

When TTL expires:

> Packet is discarded.



This prevents packets from circulating forever.


---

1️⃣9️⃣ Firewall

A firewall controls network traffic according to security rules.

Internet
    ↓
┌───────────┐
│ FIREWALL  │
└───────────┘
    ↓
Internal Network

It can inspect:

IP addresses

Ports

Protocols

Connection state

Application traffic, depending on firewall type



---

2️⃣0️⃣ Packet Filtering Firewall

Uses rules such as:

Allow TCP 443
Block TCP 23
Allow internal subnet
Block unknown traffic

Example:

TCP 443 → ✅
TCP 23  → ❌


---

2️⃣1️⃣ Stateful Firewall

A stateful firewall tracks the state of connections.

Example:

Client → Server
   SYN
   ↓
Connection tracked
   ↓
Return traffic
   ↓
Allowed if valid

It understands whether packets belong to an established/expected connection.


---

2️⃣2️⃣ Proxy Firewall

A proxy acts as an intermediary.

Client
  ↓
Proxy
  ↓
Internet

The client doesn't directly communicate with the destination server in the same way as a simple packet-forwarding setup.


---

2️⃣3️⃣ VPN

VPN = Virtual Private Network

It creates a protected communication tunnel over an underlying network.

Laptop
  ╲
   ╲ Encrypted Tunnel
    ╲
     VPN Server
        ↓
     Internet

VPNs can provide:

Confidentiality

Integrity

Authentication


depending on the VPN technology and configuration.


