🔥 2️⃣8️⃣ Common GATE Traps

Trap 1

ARP does NOT convert:

❌ Domain → IP

It converts:

✅ IP → MAC


---

Trap 2

DNS does NOT directly provide MAC addresses.

✅ DNS → IP


---

Trap 3

DHCP does not just assign an IP.

It can also provide:

Mask

Gateway

DNS

Lease information



---

Trap 4

Ping doesn't use TCP.

✅ Ping uses ICMP Echo messages.


---

Trap 5

NAT is not encryption.

NAT:

> Address translation



VPN/TLS/IPsec:

> Can provide security properties depending on configuration.




